{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（31日）凌晨4時許，警方接報指，位於大圍富健街18號的仁安醫院、一間建築公司由貨櫃改裝的辦公室起火。</p><p>消防接報到場見到火光，迅速將火撲熄，經調查後相信漏電肇禍，起火原因沒有可疑，貨櫃內有物件遭到燒毀及熏黑。事件中，無人受傷。</p><figure><img alt=\"消防到場向貨櫃辦公室射水。（李家傑攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260731/1159728744924057600047318.jpeg/RmDGzhLPUly4EeNZaLxDqBVe_GwPJrYu6d2rodPdq6E\"/><figcaption>消防到場向貨櫃辦公室射水。（李家傑攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防到場向貨櫃辦公室射水。（李家傑攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260731/1159728748338352128021934.jpeg/ALrIMwxWKGy5GLXnxM3vKF-Der4qDCbJsy00WYktNFk\"/><figcaption>消防到場向貨櫃辦公室射水。（李家傑攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"貨櫃辦公室發生火警。（李家傑攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260731/1159728750779568128514862.jpeg/SoxX6uZ3uTBd0ONftES8anZYzWN5TQdv-nYijcB2Io0\"/><figcaption>貨櫃辦公室發生火警。（李家傑攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防到場。（李家傑攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260731/1159728754030284800879650.jpeg/iBYk_Xc9BViET1KrTzncK3E4HSQs9f9eighHEbAIRxE\"/><figcaption>消防到場。（李家傑攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"仁安醫院。（李家傑攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260731/1159728741379739648381549.jpeg/E8VpoIkjqztRoTu3ankIn6vQmU1W3SOBsSbVKYsm1Sk\"/><figcaption>仁安醫院。（李家傑攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-30T22:39:00.078557+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":196,"images":5,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}